# Calculator System - MBSE Text Notation Example
# This example demonstrates the text notation for a simple calculator system

# Main component and its core process
{calculator}-O(execute numerical operations)->[numerical results]

# Component composition - calculator is composed of sub-components
{calculator}-∆{keypad}, {screen}, {processing chip}

# Detailed process flow starting from keypad
{keypad}-O(input numbers)->[numbers]->(sum numbers)->[number]->(display result)O-{screen}
